assets/steam/apps/3026000/extras/cc343ab395e8c9007cd938403e0470eb.webm?t=1731376352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026000/extras/cc343ab395e8c9007cd938403e0470eb.mp4?t=1731376352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Spaces, Adjust Strategies:</strong> Surviving in the shattered space, you will gradually unlock more complete areas. Different spaces possess distinct environments and challenges. Adjust your strategies and embark on new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join &quot;Broken Space Traveler&quot; now and embark on your cross-dimensional adventure!</p>",
